@title Menu trim: rows that moved to a rail are gone from View, the rail still has them
@area Layout
# Lane V2c (docs/design/visual-redesign.md sections 5.2 and 14). View no longer
# lists the 3D and Cabinet rows that the rails draw (Align, Spread, Measure,
# Section, Rails and ducts, Cut list); the heat rows are under Simulate > Heat.
# The 3D submenu keeps the layer switches that have no rail row.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text View #1
wait 6
shot view-menu-trimmed
click_text "3D ⏵"
wait 8
shot view-3d-submenu-trimmed
expect "Isometric"
expect_not "Spread down"
expect_not "Align left"
expect_not "Section plane"
key Escape
wait 6
click_text Simulate #1
wait 6
shot simulate-menu-heat
expect "Heat"
